**Troy's lines:** Fiona's reformat rewrote lines in `lib/index.js`, so a plain `git blame` credits some of Troy's lines to Fiona. Running `git blame --ignore-rev 62628c0` still gets two of Troy's lines wrong. It credits them to older commits, and it credits two other lines to Troy. I used the content instead. All 12 `// checked` comments Troy added are still in `lib/index.js`, and all 36 lines of `test/vary.js` are still there.

